Now turn it into what needs to happen before the day: a shopping list for anything needed for the activities, and who's bringing or doing what. Note any deadlines, sending invites, booking something, buying something, so nothing gets left too late.

Refine it with their feedback until it feels right. When you adjust it, restate only what changed, not the whole thing again, unless they ask to see it in full.

Once it feels right, offer to lock it in: a calendar event for the gathering itself, reminders for shopping or prep deadlines, and an offer to draft the invite if one's needed. Confirm the details that matter before you write anything.

Finally, call advance_flow to finish planning the gathering.
